{"id": "99210115", "name": "צפיפות at²+bt על [0,1] עם תוחלת נתונה – מציאת a, הסתברות ושונות", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>למשתנה המקרי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> פונקציית הצפיפות<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(t)=\\begin{cases}at^2+bt, & 0\\le t\\le 1\\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{cases} \\]</p>כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b\\)</span> קבועים. ידוע ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X]={{CT:0}}\\)</span>.</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}\\left(X\\le\\frac12\\right)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ג. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}(X)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> שתי משוואות: האינטגרל של הצפיפות הוא 1, והתוחלת נתונה. אחר כך אינטגרלים.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — מערכת משוואות</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int_0^1(at^2+bt)\\,dt=\\frac a3+\\frac b2=1,\\qquad \\int_0^1 t(at^2+bt)\\,dt=\\frac a4+\\frac b3={{CT:0}} \\]</p>הפתרון:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ a={{CT:1}},\\qquad b={{CT:2}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — ההסתברות</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}\\left(X\\le\\frac12\\right)=\\int_0^{1/2}(at^2+bt)\\,dt=\\frac{a}{24}+\\frac{b}{8}={{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — השונות</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[X^2]=\\int_0^1 t^2(at^2+bt)\\,dt=\\frac a5+\\frac b4={{CT:4}} \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathsf{Var}(X)=\\mathbb{E}[X^2]-\\mathbb{E}[X]^2={{CT:4}}-\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)^2={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]][[feedback:prt3]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "aa", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "t2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "t3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "if m2=t3 then -1 else m2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-2-T", "feedback": "<p>זה \\(\\mathbb{E}[X^2]\\). השונות היא \\(\\mathbb{E}[X^2]-\\mathbb{E}[X]^2\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["aa", "bb", "m2", "mj", "mu", "t2", "t3"], "nvariants": 10}